  <!-- EN: bastionmeld -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.label>鐵骸母獸</FH_Bastionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, coordinated by a loosely connected central nervous system. Its body is embedded with the remnants of various mechanoids. Through some form of supernatural energy, the bastionmeld controls weapons that once belonged to mechanoids. Bastionmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. In combat, the bastionmeld continually assembles armed fleshbeasts and defeats its enemies through long-range fire. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.description>由數十隻小型血肉獸組成的龐然大物，通過鬆散相連的中樞神經系統協調統一。身軀上鑲嵌著各種機械族的殘骸。通過某種超自然能量控制著這些原本屬於機械族的武裝。鐵骸母獸很少出現在襲擊中，通常只能通過儀式召喚。鐵骸母獸在戰鬥中通常會不斷組裝持槍血肉獸，以遠距離戰鬥戰勝敵人。</FH_Bastionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>從{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出現。</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Beam Incinerator Cannon -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.0.label>焚滅脈衝炮</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Flesh weapon mount -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.1.label>血肉武器基座</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Flesh weapon mount -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.2.label>血肉武器基座</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.2.label>
  <!-- EN: Flesh weapon mount -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.3.label>血肉武器基座</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompUnitMultiTurret_Bastionmeld.turrets.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The host grows two weapon slots that can mount weapons and use the mounted weapons to attack. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長兩個武器插槽，可安裝武器，並使用所安裝的武器進行攻擊。</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Weapon slot -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>武器插槽</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh mutualism mood -6; Social Impact -10%; grants impossible regeneration; adds two parasitic weapon mounts. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；扭曲肉容量+400；宿主獲得再生（不可思議）；提供2個額外的寄生武器裝備位。</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
