  <!-- EN: dreadmeld -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.label>驚懼母獸</FH_Dreadmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A gargantuan amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts linked together by a loosely shared central nervous system. It uses its massive claws to dig tunnels through solid rock. Fleshbeast dreadmelds are rarely seen above ground, instead sheltering in caverns built from living flesh. They share a psychic connection with the flesh used to create their burrow. -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.description>由數十隻小型血肉獸聚合而成的龐然巨物，以鬆散共享的中樞神經系統連接在一起。它會用巨大的爪肢在堅巖中挖掘隧道。驚懼母獸很少出現在地表，通常棲身於活體血肉構成的洞窟中，並與構成巢穴的血肉保持心靈連接。</FH_Dreadmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>從{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出現。</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows two meld beast tentacles that deal 14 sharp damage every 2 seconds with 40% armor penetration. -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長兩條母獸觸手，每條造成14點銳器傷害，攻擊冷卻2秒，護甲穿透40%。</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Meld beast tentacle -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>母獸觸手</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；扭曲肉容量+400；宿主獲得再生（不可思議）；採礦速度+160%；深鑽井操作速度+70%；提供兩條母獸觸手和“驚懼咆哮”主動能力。</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: left bone spike -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.tools.left_bone_spike.label>左骨刺</FH_Dreadmeld.tools.left_bone_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: right bone spike -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.tools.right_bone_spike.label>右骨刺</FH_Dreadmeld.tools.right_bone_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.tools.head.label>頭</FH_Dreadmeld.tools.head.label>

  <!-- EN: fissionmeld -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.label>裂殖母獸</FH_Fissionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. Its body undergoes constant rapid hyperplasia, with new fleshbeasts budding from its form at regular intervals. These parasitic offspring make the fissionmeld a terrifying meat grinder. Fissionmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. Upon death, the fissionmeld enters a dormant state and will eventually regenerate. -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.description>由數十隻小型血肉獸聚合而成的龐然巨物，以鬆散連接的中樞神經系統維繫整體。它的身體持續高速增生，會定期從軀體上萌生新的血肉獸。這些寄生子嗣讓裂殖母獸成為可怕的血肉絞肉機。裂殖母獸很少出現在襲擊中，通常只能通過儀式召喚。死亡後，裂殖母獸會進入休眠狀態，並最終再生。</FH_Fissionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>從{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出現。</FH_Fissionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows two meld beast tentacles that deal 14 sharp damage every 2 seconds with 40% armor penetration. -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長兩條母獸觸手，每條造成14點銳器傷害，攻擊冷卻2秒，護甲穿透40%。</FH_Fissionmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
