  <!-- EN: furiousmeld -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.label>暴怒母獸</FH_Furiousmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. It grows a thick carapace of living iron and can project a spherical bioprotective forcefield that allows bullets to pass out but not in. Furiousmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. In combat, the furiousmeld charges headlong to destroy defenses, clearing a path for lesser fleshbeasts to overwhelm the enemy. -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.description>由數十隻小型血肉獸聚合而成的龐然巨物，以鬆散連接的中樞神經系統維繫整體。它生有厚重的活體鋼鐵甲殼，並能投射球形生物防護力場，允許子彈由內向外穿過，卻會阻擋外部射擊。暴怒母獸很少出現在襲擊中，通常只能通過儀式召喚。戰鬥時，它會正面衝鋒摧毀防禦，為較小的血肉獸開闢突破敵陣的道路。</FH_Furiousmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>從{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中出現。</FH_Furiousmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows two shield-claw tentacles that deal 16 blunt damage every 3 seconds. -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主體表生長兩條盾爪觸手，每條造成16點鈍器傷害，攻擊冷卻3秒。</FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Shield-claw tentacle -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>盾爪觸手</FH_Furiousmeld.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: left bone spike -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.left_bone_spike.label>左骨刺</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.left_bone_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: right bone spike -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.right_bone_spike.label>右骨刺</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.right_bone_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: carapace -->
